            text = "010546: I-yu-ye-no yi-di-tsi-ge-yu-ha ge-tsi-ge-yu-hi, ga-do ye-tsa-gu-yv-da-si?  Tla-s-go na-s-gi yi-na-na-dv-ne-ho a-ye-li--a-de-lv a-ni-gi-si-do-hi?"
